{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37819","headline":"寄左省张起居 · 郑谷","name":"寄左省张起居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"含香复记言，清秩称当年。\n点笔非常笔，朝天最近天。\n家声三相後，公事一人前。\n诗句江郎伏，书踪甯氏传。\n风标欺鹭鹤，才力涌沙泉。\n居僻贫无虑，名高退更坚。\n渔舟思静泛，僧榻寄闲眠。\n消息当弥入，丝纶的粲然。\n依栖常接迹，属和旧盈编。\n开口人皆信，凄凉是谢毡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}